    "description": "<p>North River observational data&nbsp;in support of manuscript \"Tidal intrusion fronts, surface convergence, and mixing in an estuary with complex topography\". Fieldwork&nbsp;in Oct - Nov&nbsp;2021. CTD data and ADCP data collected during shipboard surveys at a channel constriction and a bend. CTD data and Aquadopp data collected at multiple mooring sites.</p>",
